    {
      "id": "699c0fa6-2f20-42f4-a470-6ea0bd1656cb",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "01e9f395-d628-4426-a4a2-89a7322b0637",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Register: Rivet\nmaintains valves.\nDot verifies\nreadings. Moxie",
                "carries failed\nmessage copies.\nPip records faults\nand informs",
                "residents. The\nclerk keeps the\npublic access\nagreement. Slush\noffers",
                "his roof crew for\nlodge repairs,\nsubject to the\nsame written fault",
                "log."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a4d4b08f-03d7-4695-adf7-28a45ecd28f5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1cdfadd4-6df0-4717-a22b-bf4d65d3bf80",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "A resident reports\na cold room but\nthe current gauge\nreading is",
                "unverified. Pip\nmust acknowledge\nthe resident and\nrecord the report.",
                "Dot checks the\nreading. Rivet\ndecides the\nmechanical repair\nfrom",
                "verified evidence.\nMoxie carries a\ncopy if the signal\nreply fails.",
                "One draft skips\nstraight from\ncomplaint to\nordering Rivet to\nreplace",
                "the pump. The\nclerk asks who has\nbeen left out, and\nwhy that",
                "omission matters."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a7c628e-2158-45c2-af10-6791f41f2a7c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0cd5e5b2-4513-4376-a034-3e9cb07f637d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "A message has no\nreceived mark. Who\nis assigned to\ncarry its backup",
                "copy?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c09fdb81-ecd4-4022-ac01-1340d2dc5e7f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "a26f6d87-3cf9-43ac-a45d-c46761166d4d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib reads the\nproposed\nsettlement:\nverified repair\ncosts are repaid",
                "from the public\nfund in recorded\ninstallments. No\ntenant loses a",
                "home to pay it.\nSlush gives up the\nsealed estate\npriority. The city",
                "takes an actual\ndebt, not a\nflattering favor."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c088d868-1a59-4770-a3c8-9449bd5d5160",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "09f198b8-386a-42e9-a12a-3f11bd78ac47",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Before choosing a\nmechanical\nreplacement, whose\nassigned work must",
                "occur in the\nexample? The\nresident report is\nreal and should be",
                "acknowledged. It\ndoes not by itself\nidentify which\npart failed.",
                "Choose the missing\nverification\nhandoff, so the\nduty register",
                "protects both the\nresident from\ndelay and the\nbuilder from\nrepairing",
                "a guess."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "338b7236-768d-4e75-ad12-0233e3c059c1",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "14a4ff45-e161-415d-a335-566f99cba8b6",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Slush: I still\nprefer a building\nwith my name on\nit. But a city\nthat",
                "works is a better\nneighbor than an\nestate surrounded\nby cold. He",
                "offers the\numbrella to Pip,\nwho discovers it\nis heavy because\nthe",
                "handle stores\ntwelve emergency\nforms."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
